<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9949" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντί-θεσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>opposition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				257e
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				258b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίθεσιν ἔχειν πρός τι</span>”
				<i>correspond to . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					503a25
				</span></i>
			; <i>resistance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				12.200
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Logic,
				<i>opposition</i> of propositions, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Int.</u>
				19b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Top.</u>
				113b15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1054a23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>substitution of the contradictory,</i> as 'not-man' for 'man',
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ σὺν -θέσει ἀντιστροφή,</span>
			conversion <i>by negation,</i> e.g. 'man is an animal ∴
			what is not an animal cannot be a man', <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>in SE</u>
				15.23
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>antithesis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				12.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1410a22
			</span></i>; in forensic oratory, <i>counter-proposition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>change</i> or <i>transposition</i> of a letter,
				Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.945
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diom.
				1.442K.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
